              "text": "The staff reaches four tiles. Casting has a short wind-up, then the bolt travels to the target. Moving or switching activities interrupts your current action. This staff doesn\u2019t need arrows or runes."
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "back",
              "text": "Something else...",
              "nextNodeId": "start"
